B.S6=s(["Developed a Flutter application for real-time water usage monitoring, including interactive dashboards, consumption charts, and user-specific usage records.","Structured application modules using BLoC and integrated secure REST APIs, separating business logic from the user interface and supporting reliable data exchange.","Improved onboarding, navigation, dashboard presentation, and cross-platform mobile workflows to deliver a clearer and more accessible user experience."],t.s)
